e and  you know when the the supports like it  was the the last couple of years it  makes a huge difference in the matches  um and i'll i'll try and use that again  this year  so you've had a bit of time to work with  emily how's that going and how are you  getting along yeah i've i've loved it so  far i've really enjoyed having her  around we spent five days on the court  now we practice on sunday  um every day through until  thursday obviously today and uh yeah  it's been it's been great uh we talked  we had dinner last night and spoke about  you know coming back as defending  champion and how she handled it and  things she did well and didn't do so  well  so that's definitely something that she  can you know help me with over the next  couple of days  and then yeah the practices we've had  have been good fun i've enjoyed being on  the court and that's  that's very important you know i've  worked hard  prepared well and i've enjoyed it so  have you actually hit with her  we're gonna hit tomorrow uh i'm only i'm  having a light practice tomorrow so  that'll be the first time we've hit  together she's gone off this evening to  get some grass court shoes and some  whites so to practice yeah she's gonna  have some balls tomorrow

